<body lang=EN-IN style='tab-interval:36.0pt;word-wrap:break-word'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<h1><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>V4
IA Renaming &amp; Reordering Document<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

<p><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>This document outlines the
complete internal transformation of the V4 Information Architecture. <b>No
underlying routes, pages, or data structures were altered.</b> This overhaul
strictly renames the user-facing labels and reorders the items to be highly
intuitive, matching modern SaaS standards.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>1.
Top-Level Modules<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

